{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1e42595d8e0bb73000347941067a7199eb57acb20bdf8016d72aa7c8df03b28", "ja": "（今日は瑞希のPV撮影日。瑞希の熱い思いが込められ\nよりクールでカッコいい映像になりそうだ……）", "zh": "（今天是瑞希的PV拍摄日。融入了瑞希热烈心意的影像，似乎会变得更加酷炫帅气……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "4a4677f5c4b7072347d3b76d5e3ef1e076ead3e55ba12feefe5e2c012eb647f3", "ja": "はいオッケーです！\n真壁さん、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "好的，没问题！\n真壁小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "62d4e7407cebdf97d82279e815c158a2d5d9c1764a6b209d306dc5855d628bb9", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nあの、今の演技は……どうだったでしょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n那个，刚才的演技……您觉得怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1003_p", "source_sha256": "218c5d5a0d198632d4a5760b3cb84965f800bd79684e2f9a7f42bfb286876694", "ja": "瑞希のクールさが表れてて、\nすごい魅力的な演技だったと思うよ。", "zh": "能体现出瑞希的冷酷感，\n我觉得是非常有魅力的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "dda6054debf8c7a8f2e167760630f8f58729f074a93c45a6410761945369a3d6", "ja": "そうですか……。『Silent Joker』は\n私にとって思い入れのある曲ですから。", "zh": "这样啊……《Silent Joker》对我来说是一首很有意义的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "a1a26cc53c9ed847ed5a4027a5ab88b9b334b09c79bf250946991d3a5e1cb01d", "ja": "{$P$}に\nそう言ってもらえたなら大成功だぞ。", "zh": "能得到{$P$}这样的评价，就算大成功了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "c8c666d4bd5389d0b64ee545b50a42b58057f6836b91d777d5eadbe35dcdb6ec", "ja": "うん。大成功……。", "zh": "嗯。大成功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de22ce00d93f667ea3a6a188ccfd13ca49725bd42c63ccefc771f58f3494fd79", "ja": "……？　瑞希？", "zh": "……？瑞希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "25c28be1c143aff0e833f775fbd6dd809ba9a7274160fd1432adc1103b5c248b", "ja": "いえ。まさか、この曲のPVができるとは思わなくて。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "没什么。只是没想到，这首歌居然能拍PV。\n{$P$}，非常感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "cbbcda3d93f12fe75ad8ecb33da961683b82533b1100d3c8f40a5dd4b07404a1", "ja": "お礼の気持ちを手品で表現したいところですが、\nあいにく、道具を楽屋に置いてきてしまいました。", "zh": "虽然很想用魔术表达我的谢意，可惜把道具落在后台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1010_p", "source_sha256": "63b1f1b3687ffcf4325db40004120b1167e8055eb0711c3628000c9fd7cc7236", "ja": "はは、お礼は大丈夫だよ。\nそれよりも、正直に話してくれないか？", "zh": "哈哈，不用特意道谢啦。\n比起这个，能不能跟我说实话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1012_p", "source_sha256": "457b67f06692ec89940b43e507eea4b7e01364eb50899f9e3973c8b63b3d511c", "ja": "違うかもしれないけど……\n今の撮影、瑞希は納得してない気がしたんだけど。", "zh": "也许不是这样……但我觉得，刚才的拍摄好像没能让瑞希满意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "7c035a0fcf521295b344cd133080be27a455a4e66e0f4a8bb9f3b29f4fec0d13", "ja": "…………！\n{$P$}、なぜそれを。", "zh": "…………！\n{$P$}，您为什么会知道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1014_p", "source_sha256": "40fd51b0fa72af05bdf4dc8c5eefa9069c6e6c3091a66a5756f4806c36685050", "ja": "俺は瑞希のプロデューサーだからな。\nそれに……瑞希の顔を見てたら、わかるよ。", "zh": "因为我是瑞希的制作人嘛。\n而且……看着瑞希的表情，就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "ccc56dd50d65c9e931217aa5e0568628d050a9603e2312741b6079ca05b8956d", "ja": "なんと、お見通しでしたか。\n{$P$}の仰る通りです。", "zh": "原来您都看透了啊。\n正如{$P$}所说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "a599156cc1921e8c7223be1a5888a8f88508ee4b7c87262b406e62ae0ecb2261", "ja": "私は、何度もこの曲でステージに立ってきました。\nファンのみなさんにもたくさん応援していただいて。", "zh": "我已经用这首歌登上舞台很多次了。\n也一直得到各位粉丝的大力支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "9ae167684731bf853c97cf77b7b13dca63c0d69068e5a6d34599172df09cdd69", "ja": "でも……先程の演技では、感謝の気持ちを\n十分に込められていないような気がしたんです。", "zh": "可是……刚才的表演，我总觉得没能充分表达出感谢之情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7f90ebec6a51d3c10071d6174ad9fb5600f9f5832143274cab6710632ff5af10", "ja": "なるほどな。そういうことなら、\nもう一度撮影できないか、掛け合ってみよう。", "zh": "原来如此。既然这样，我去试着争取一下，看看能不能再拍一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "4eff80fc23b69846ebe0a2eaa2bca26687b83099fd534a26eebf1d9b84411a23", "ja": "いいんですか？　これは、私のわがままで……。", "zh": "可以吗？这都是因为我的任性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1020_p", "source_sha256": "835ac0672a67709de59d5f7e6394700867c1cc6813ac8bdad3d036c63db3c286", "ja": "いいんだよ。瑞希が届けたいと思った人たちに、\nその思いを届けてあげてほしいんだ。", "zh": "没关系。瑞希想传达给那些人，\n我就希望你能把这份心意传达给他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "1eb583321bc8959eb93793b2009b82583de99cb3ae4455d22582cfc94889356d", "ja": "{$P$}……。ありがとうございます。\nそれでは、お言葉に甘えさせていただきます。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢您。\n那么，我就恭敬不如从命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0474_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "735f6abe2b8883ff6204d0a44092ae2fe4f1f1a38bf496eec29259b773c35992", "ja": "もう一度、全力で頑張ってみます。\n{$P$}、ちゃんと見ててくださいね。", "zh": "我会再拼尽全力试一次的。\n{$P$}，请您一定要好好看着我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
